WEBVTT

NOTE
Eden - Eternal Breath. Cosmic GF, the longest summon in the game.
Observed duration in reference video: ~85 seconds.
Multi-phase animation: cosmic chamber, planetary alignment, energy buildup, beam.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Eden. Eternal Breath.

00:02.500 --> 00:10.000
The screen plunges into deep space. Stars wheel past at impossible speed.

00:10.000 --> 00:18.000
A vast cathedral-like construct hangs in the void — Eden, all silver tracery and cosmic glass.

00:18.000 --> 00:28.000
Concentric rings of energy fan out from Eden as it begins to charge.

00:28.000 --> 00:38.000
Galaxies spiral around the construct; the universe bends toward it.

00:38.000 --> 00:48.000
A massive sphere of energy gathers at Eden's core, blazing white-gold.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
The sphere becomes a planet-sized cannon. Eden aims it across the void.

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A reality-warping beam streaks through space and slams into the enemies.

01:12.000 --> 01:20.000
The cosmic beam fades. The starfield collapses back into normal space.

01:20.000 --> 01:25.000
Eden recedes into the void.
